    "\n",
    "**Dermalens Skin Cancer Classification Pipeline**\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook builds on Milestone 1 output (train/dev/test splits) to:\n",
    "1. Validate data quality and integrity\n",
    "2. Perform comprehensive exploratory data analysis (EDA)\n",
    "3. Preprocess images (resize, normalize)\n",
    "4. Engineer tabular features (age scaling, categorical encoding)\n",
    "5. Prepare final feature matrices for model training (M3)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Principle:** All preprocessing decisions are justified by EDA findings and documented for reproducibility."
   ]
  },
